  "description": "This Building Block proposes a schema representation of the OpenEO process [`exp`](https://processes.openeo.org/#exp) \u2014 *Exponentiation to the base e*. It models the `arguments` object of a process graph node invoking `exp`. This is a proposed correspondence between the OpenEO process definition and an OGC Building Block schema, not a settled equivalence.\n\nExponential function to the base *e* raised to the power of `p`.\n\nNo-data values are passed through.\n\n## Source\n\nOpenEO Processes specification: [`exp`](https://processes.openeo.org/#exp) ([openeo-processes/exp.json at 2.0.0-rc.2](https://github.com/Open-EO/openeo-processes/blob/2.0.0-rc.2/exp.json)).\n",
